## What comes after the holy-shit moment

Phase 7.1 success unlocks Phases 7.2–7.10 (remaining 9 task-detail regions). Each follows the **exact same recipe**:
1. Create `packages/webui/<region>/`
2. Port the matching renderer component
3. Add WebUI controller patch
4. Wire Mojo binding
5. Swap the region slot

By 7.5 or so, this becomes mechanical. A real surface migration machine.

**The hardest part is 7.1 itself** — it de-risks the whole architecture. Every subsequent region is copying a known-working recipe.
